{{--
  Icon set — 24x24, stroked, currentColor.

  Ported from the `icons` object in ui-example/index.html, plus the handful the
  application needs that the prototype never drew (files, API keys, list
  actions). They are all from the same family, so a new one must be too.

  Usage: @!icon({ name: 'users' }) — any extra attribute is forwarded, so
  @!icon({ name: 'users', class: 'nav-icon' }) works.
--}}
